---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="About LIFT | Smart Due Diligence Platform" 
  description="LIFT is the operating layer for modern due diligence—transforming fragmented business information into structured diligence, actionable insights and decision-ready reports."
>
  <Navbar />
  
  <main class="flex-1 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-20">
      
      <!-- Section 37: About LIFT Hero -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">
          Company Purpose
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight">
          Built to change the way due diligence works.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Due diligence is critical to every important transaction. Yet the process often remains dependent on disconnected tools, manual coordination and fragmented communication.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- The Core Story -->
      <div class="glass-panel-glow rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-white/10 space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-white font-medium text-lg font-heading">
          LIFT was built around a simple question:
        </p>
        <blockquote class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border-l-4 border-indigo-500 text-slate-200 italic">
          "What if the entire due diligence process could work from one connected workflow?"
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          A platform where the checklist is structured from the beginning, documents are organised around specific requirements, experts work within defined parameters, queries remain visible, findings are captured as they emerge and decision-makers have a clearer view of what matters.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white font-semibold">
          That is LIFT.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 38: The LIFT Philosophy -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 font-mono">Foundational Principles</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white font-heading mt-2">
            Technology should remove friction—not professional judgement.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2">
            Three guiding axioms underpin every module in the LIFT operating system.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          
          <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 space-y-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center border border-indigo-500/20">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading">STRUCTURE</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Create a repeatable, standardized diligence process that eliminates ad-hoc spreadsheets and lost email threads from day one.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 space-y-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center border border-cyan-500/20">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading">INTELLIGENCE</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Use technology-assisted document intelligence to help teams process large volumes of corporate information and surface variances faster.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 space-y-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center border border-purple-500/20">
              03
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading">JUDGEMENT</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Keep professional expertise at the centre of important conclusions. Technology empowers analysts; qualified advisors verify findings.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Association with GGAM Advisory -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-400 font-mono">Professional Pedigree</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white font-heading">
          LIFT by GGAM Advisory
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          LIFT represents the synthesis of modern enterprise software engineering and deep transaction advisory experience. GGAM Advisory provides the professional credibility layer, having observed first-hand the coordination pain points that stall transactions.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pt-2">
          Note: LIFT is a software operating platform. Specialized statutory reviews, independent legal opinions, and regulatory valuations are performed in coordination with qualified practitioners subject to specific engagement scope.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center pt-8 border-t border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white font-heading">
          Ready to experience the modern DD operating platform?
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
          <a href="/contact?intent=start-dd" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-all shadow-md">
            Start a DD
          </a>
          <a href="/contact?intent=demo" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold hover:text-white transition-colors">
            Book a Demo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
